graph TD
    Start([Deployment Workflow Triggered]) --> Plan[DeploymentPlanAgent<br/>Generate Deployment Plan]
    
    Plan --> Stage1[Stage 1: Code Validation<br/>Validate docker-compose.yml<br/>Check configurations]
    
    Stage1 -->|Valid| Stage2[Stage 2: Build Containers<br/>Build Docker images<br/>Tag images]
    Stage1 -->|Invalid| Fail1([Deployment Failed<br/>Code Validation Error])
    
    Stage2 -->|Success| Stage3[Stage 3: Run Tests<br/>Backend tests<br/>Frontend tests]
    Stage2 -->|Failed| Fail2([Deployment Failed<br/>Build Error])
    
    Stage3 -->|Passed| Stage4[Stage 4: Package Artifacts<br/>Create deployment bundles<br/>Generate checksums]
    Stage3 -->|Failed| Warn1[Warning: Tests Failed<br/>Continue with caution]
    
    Warn1 --> Stage4
    Stage4 --> Stage5[Stage 5: Push to VPS Staging<br/>Upload files via SCP<br/>Deploy to staging]
    
    Stage5 -->|Success| Stage6[Stage 6: Health Checks<br/>Check service health<br/>Validate endpoints]
    Stage5 -->|Failed| Fail3([Deployment Failed<br/>Push Error])
    
    Stage6 --> Stage7[Stage 7: Supervisor Approval<br/>Request approval<br/>Validate constraints]
    
    Stage7 -->|Approved| CheckEnv{Environment?}
    Stage7 -->|Rejected| Fail4([Deployment Rejected<br/>Supervisor Denied])
    
    CheckEnv -->|Staging| Stage9[Stage 9: Post-Deployment Validation<br/>Health checks<br/>Smoke tests]
    CheckEnv -->|Production| Stage8[Stage 8: Deploy to Production<br/>Start containers<br/>Configure environment]
    
    Stage8 -->|Success| Stage9
    Stage8 -->|Failed| Fail5([Deployment Failed<br/>Production Error])
    
    Stage9 -->|All Healthy| Success([Deployment Completed<br/>All Services Healthy])
    Stage9 -->|Unhealthy| Fail6([Deployment Failed<br/>Health Check Failed])
    
    style Start fill:#e1f5ff
    style Success fill:#d4edda
    style Fail1 fill:#f8d7da
    style Fail2 fill:#f8d7da
    style Fail3 fill:#f8d7da
    style Fail4 fill:#f8d7da
    style Fail5 fill:#f8d7da
    style Fail6 fill:#f8d7da
    style Warn1 fill:#fff3cd



